<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Optical Sensors cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Optical Sensors cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Optical Sensors Inc to market perform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Earlier today, Optical Sensors said it was voluntarily recalling its SensiCath Sensors after discovering some of the sensors were not performing according to specifications.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-3/8 to 4-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
